@startuml oscal-component-diagram
component "api.py\n<<FastAPI router>>" as Api
component "config.py\n<<OscalSettings>>" as Config
component "models.py\n<<Pydantic models>>" as Models
component "markdown_converter.py\n<<orchestrator>>" as MarkdownConverter
component "normalizer.py" as Normalizer
component "chunking.py" as Chunking
component "llm_client.py\n<<ext-llm wrapper>>" as LlmClient
component "trestle_ops.py" as TrestleOps
component "workspace.py" as Workspace
component "approval.py" as Approval
component "ledger.py\n<<append-only JSONL>>" as Ledger

Api ..> Config : reads settings
Api ..> Models : (de)serializes
Api ..> MarkdownConverter : convert()
Api ..> TrestleOps : validate() / import_assemble() / profile_resolve()
Api ..> Approval : approve()

MarkdownConverter ..> Normalizer : normalize()
MarkdownConverter ..> Chunking : pack_chunks()
MarkdownConverter ..> LlmClient : convert_chunk()
MarkdownConverter ..> Ledger : append(convert)

TrestleOps ..> Workspace : workspace_path()
TrestleOps ..> Ledger : append(validate|assemble|resolve)

Approval ..> Ledger : append(approve) / read ApprovalRecord

note right of LlmClient
  wraps litellm; models ext-llm
  (research.md R2)
end note

note bottom of Normalizer
  sectioning design ported from
  oscal-document-workbench (R4/R10)
end note
@enduml
